[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":289},["ShallowReactive",2],{"U---lEO_Irv3khy0YybCQPv22w-j9g2cGBB9fzP6Vic":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":29,"location":43,"sector":44,"services":48,"introCopy":49,"storyblockAccordions":50,"storyblockAssets":60,"flexibleContent":86,"footerLinkLabel":281,"footerLinks":282},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Level Shoe District","Inspired by The Great Exhibition, this bold retail design redefines the norm—an immersive shoe district where design disrupts and scale astonishes.",null,"level-shoe-district",false,{"hex":11},"#FFFFFF",{"hex":13},"#1C1C1C","The world’s biggest shoe store, in the world’s mega mall.",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>Level Shoe District\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":28},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":14},"span",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":33},900,"",1600,{"width":32,"height":34,"url":35,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":36},910,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517470-shed_lsd_130122_6370-2.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":37,"srcSet":38,"src":39,"width":40,"height":41,"sizes":42},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517470-shed_lsd_130122_6370-2.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517470-shed_lsd_130122_6370-2.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517470-shed_lsd_130122_6370-2.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517470-shed_lsd_130122_6370-2.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517470-shed_lsd_130122_6370-2.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517470-shed_lsd_130122_6370-2.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517470-shed_lsd_130122_6370-2.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",3200,1820,"(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Dubai Mall, UAE",[45],{"slug":46,"label":47},"retail","Retail","Micro Architecture, FF&E, Interior Design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiNkNjcFhIbkw1SVl6bzNyemkxekVEdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE3MzI3NjgyNzYsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>This is retail theatre on a grand scale, inspired by The Great Exhibition. With a blank canvas of this magnitude, only bold, immersive retail design will do. This is not a store, or a department, but a &lsquo;District&rsquo; that disrupts the norm. A celebration of shoes of epic proportion. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[51,54,57],{"title":52,"copy":53},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>With a space of this scale, the challenge was to break it down into distinct environments, each with its own identity. Seamlessly connected for an immersive, multi-layered experience that took retail design to new heights.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":55,"copy":56},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiWGJVSFVxeUc3bjVjOHRLZjg4NzJVdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjEwNDA4NTE0NTYsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>Connect product and place. By designing a series of pavilion-style environments, the space naturally guides shoppers towards the array of shoes displays, each one anchored to its own surroundings. \u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":58,"copy":59},"The Solution","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>A series of pavilions that reflected the spirit, aesthetic and material palette of the product itself. This approach allowed for a seamless movement between different shoes category environments. It was disruptive but also paradoxically brought order to the vast volume of retail space.\u003Cbr />\u003Cbr />At 96,000 sq feet in size (9000sqm), Level Shoe District became a luxury footwear destination like no other. With over 250 shoe designers and 40 in-store boutiques including Dior, Prada, Louis Vuitton, Christian Louboutin and Saint Laurent to name a few.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>\u003Cbr />\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[61,73,83],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":62},{"width":63,"height":64,"url":65,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":66},5529,3132,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517509-shed_lsd_130123_7068.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":67,"srcSet":68,"src":69,"width":70,"height":71,"sizes":72},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517509-shed_lsd_130123_7068.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517509-shed_lsd_130123_7068.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517509-shed_lsd_130123_7068.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517509-shed_lsd_130123_7068.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517509-shed_lsd_130123_7068.jpg?dpr=1.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 3141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517509-shed_lsd_130123_7068.jpg?dpr=2&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 4188w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517509-shed_lsd_130123_7068.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736517509-shed_lsd_130123_7068.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=cr