1736519147-level-3-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=1740 1740w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736519147-level-3-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=1740 435w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736519147-level-3-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=1740 870w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736519147-level-3-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=1740 1740w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736519147-level-3-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=1740",{"_modelApiKey":128,"title":226,"sideCopy":227,"mainCopy":228},"'Designer'","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Arguably the most avant-guard of all the pavilions, this space was encased in dramatic blackened metal walls, making a bold, uncompromising design statement.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiNkNjcFhIbkw1SVl6bzNyemkxekVEdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjUwNDY1Mzc4MiwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>&lsquo;Designer&rsquo; pavilion was altogether darker and explicitly more confident. Rich purples and gunmetal cuts through the more deluxe finishes elsewhere. Without the product this pavilion could have been Dubai&rsquo;s new favourite nightclub.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":92,"assets":230},[231,238],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":232},{"width":96,"height":97,"url":233,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":234},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736524321-c-level-shoe-district-2-2048x1280-3.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":235,"srcSet":236,"src":237,"width":32,"height":103,"sizes":104},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736524321-c-level-shoe-district-2-2048x1280-3.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=1600 400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/